<view class="page feature-page group-detail"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="拼团详情"></brand-header><view wx:if="{{offer}}"><view class="pad"><view class="group-detail-image"><media-placeholder src="{{offer.image}}" label="拼团商品主图" fit="aspectFit" blank="{{true}}" kind="product"></media-placeholder><text class="group-image-count">1/1</text></view><view class="group-detail-countdown panel"><text>拼团价更优</text><view class="group-detail-clock"><text>剩余</text><text class="group-detail-time">{{countdown.days}}</text><text>天</text><text class="group-detail-time">{{countdown.hours}}</text><text>:</text><text class="group-detail-time">{{countdown.minutes}}</text><text>:</text><text class="group-detail-time">{{countdown.seconds}}</text></view></view><view class="group-detail-summary panel"><view class="group-detail-price-line"><view class="group-detail-price"><text>¥</text>{{offer.displayPrice}}</view><text class="pill">{{offer.members}}人团</text></view><view class="group-detail-joined">已参团{{offer.joined}}人</view><view class="group-detail-name">{{offer.name}}</view><view class="group-detail-original">单独购买 ¥{{offer.displaySingle}}<text>原价 ¥{{offer.displayOriginal}}</text></view></view><view class="group-detail-section panel"><view class="between"><text class="group-detail-section-title">{{teams.length ? teams.length + '人在拼单，可直接参与' : '暂无进行中的拼单'}}</text><button class="more" bindtap="allTeams" wx:if="{{teams.length}}">查看全部<ui-icon name="chevron" size="21"></ui-icon></button></view><view class="group-team-row" wx:for="{{teams}}" wx:key="id"><view class="group-team-avatar"><ui-icon name="user" size="37"></ui-icon></view><view class="group-team-person"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text>示例拼团</text></view><view class="group-team-status"><view>还差<text>{{item.remaining}}</text>人成团</view><text>剩余 {{item.countdown.days}}天{{item.countdown.hours}}:{{item.countdown.minutes}}:{{item.countdown.seconds}}</text></view><button class="group-join-button" bindtap="join" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{submitting || countdown.ended}}">{{hasOrder ? '看订单' : item.own ? '我的团' : '去拼团'}}</button></view></view><button class="group-detail-section group-clinic-row panel" bindtap="chooseClinic"><view><view class="group-detail-section-title">适用门店</view><view class="card-note">{{clinic.name}}</view></view><view class="more">选择门店<ui-icon name="chevron" size="23"></ui-icon></view></button><view class="group-detail-section panel"><view class="section-title">拼团规则</view><view class="group-rule-row"><text>01</text><view>{{offer.members}}人成团，本活动每人限购{{offer.limit}}单。{{offer.audience === 'new-only' ? '参团仅限无历史核销记录的新客。' : '新客老客均可参团。'}}{{offer.initiator === 'new-only' ? '发起人须为新客。' : '发起人不限新老客。'}}</view></view><view class="group-rule-row"><text>02</text><view>开团后24小时内有效，不超过活动截止时间。</view></view><view class="group-rule-row"><text>03</text><view>具体服务内容、项目适用性与到院安排，以机构面诊确认结果为准。</view></view></view><view class="group-detail-section panel"><view class="section-title">商品详情</view><view class="group-detail-long-image"><media-placeholder label="商品详情图片待补充" blank="{{true}}" fit="aspectFit"></media-placeholder></view></view><view class="notice">此页价格、已拼人数与拼单用户为示例资料。开团、参团和单独购买仅操作本地演示数据，不产生真实交易。</view></view><view class="bottom-action group-purchase-bar"><view class="group-toolbar-shortcuts"><button bindtap="support"><ui-icon name="headset" size="42"></ui-icon><text>客服</text></button><button open-type="share"><ui-icon name="arrow" size="42"></ui-icon><text>分享</text></button></view><view class="group-purchase-buttons"><button class="group-single-button" bindtap="single" disabled="{{submitting || (countdown.ended && !hasOrder)}}"><text>{{hasOrder ? '查看订单' : '单独购买'}}</text><text>¥{{offer.displaySingle}}</text></button><button class="group-main-button" bindtap="start" disabled="{{submitting || (countdown.ended && !hasOrder)}}"><text>{{hasOrder ? '查看订单' : offer.members + '人拼单'}}</text><text>¥{{offer.displayPrice}}</text></button></view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty"><view class="empty-title">暂未找到此拼团活动</view><text>请返回列表选择当前活动</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="backToList">查看拼团列表</button></view></view>
